WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.462
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Copy, Move and Delete Files.

2
00:00:06.762 --> 00:00:10.970
Manage your files with shortcuts. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:11.983 --> 00:00:16.136
Step one. Click a file once to select it. It turns blue.

4
00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:21.254
Step two. Press Control and C together to copy the file.

5
00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:31.189
Step three. Open the folder where you want the copy. Press Control and V to paste. To move a file instead, use Control and X, then paste.

6
00:00:32.183 --> 00:00:39.506
Step four. To delete, select the file and press Delete. The file goes to the Recycle Bin, so you can still get it back.

7
00:00:40.517 --> 00:00:44.539
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:44.839 --> 00:00:46.653
Copy a photo to your Desktop.

9
00:00:46.953 --> 00:00:51.483
Move a file into your Homework folder with Ctrl+X and Ctrl+V.

10
00:00:51.783 --> 00:00:54.746
Delete a test file, then restore it from the Recycle Bin.

11
00:00:55.046 --> 00:00:55.990
Well done!

